        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository bc7ca5bb-5338-4242-8e65-8562ab521bd6).Image",
        "Description": "In the distant year of 2067, the world has been taken over by Kronstadt Industries&apos; omnipotent AI overlord known only as KnoxNet. In a last ditch effort to save humanity, the rebellion has sent a reprogrammed T-47 assassination unit back in time to eliminate the minds behind the project.\rThe battle for the future will be fought in the past. The fate of the world rests on your success.\rFor extra style, an unsuppressed firearm such as The Striker is recommended to truly embody the T-47.",
